<mw12F schema="1" type="pattern" name="Skip Step Fill" author="mwAudio" tags="Breaks,Variation,Melodic Line,Slides,Octave Jumps,Shuffle,Ratchet" description="Breaks line in C, about 120 BPM: a fill in the last beat, from the scene Skip Step.">
